cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its reported measurements, please cite it as below."
title: "BioReaction Atlas: representation dependence in reaction retrieval for new-to-nature biocatalysis"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible descriptive study comparing four reaction representations
  (substrate Morgan, signed Morgan difference, DRFP and RXNFP) on a hash-pinned
  pool of 639 enzyme-reference and 1,988 patent-reference reactions, with
  tie-aware agreement metrics, a shared-publication exclusion control, and an
  evidence-linked protocol for a subsequent discovery-event precedent audit.
type: software
authors:
